# pqctoday-priv/local-evidence-cache/migrate-proofs/; manifest/skip-list stay
# tracked here exactly as before (unchanged by this move).
public/migrate-proofs/*.html
public/migrate-proofs/*.pdf

# Vendor roadmap proof pages (HTML/PDF) — NEW 2026-07-12: this whole directory
