# EXCEPT the Developer tabs' Pyodide shim sources (dev-tabs-pkcs11-kmip plan)
# — these are product source, not private tooling: they ship into Pyodide's
# filesystem at runtime (via public/pyodide-shims/, synced from these by
# `npm run sync:pyodide-shims`) and are what a learner's script actually
# imports. Found missing from git history 2026-08-28 after `git add` on this
# directory silently no-op'd against the blanket rule above (only the
# public/ synced COPY had been committed, never the real source) — same
# class of trap as the documented scripts/* gitignore gotcha. Path updated
# same day when the whole directory moved out from under src/wasm/ (that
# directory is eslint-excluded repo-wide, which had been silently exempting
# this hand-written code from lint too) — update this path again if it
# ever moves again, or the trap recurs silently.
